      "html": "<p>South America: upper Uruguay River basin (La Plata, Uruguay, Upper Uruguay, Pelotas). Type locality: Rio Pelotas at Volta Grande Dois, Marcelino Ramos, Rio Grande do Sul, Brazil.</p>"
